question_ind:
Diberikan sebuah karakter operator dan dua bilangan riil. Lakukan operasi berikut:
  - '+': penjumlahan;
  - '-': bilangan pertama dikurangi bilangan kedua;
  - '*': perkalian;
  - '/': bilangan pertama dibagi bilangan kedua;
  - operator lain: keluarkan "unknown operation".
  Input: Sebuah karakter operator, diikuti dua bilangan riil a dan b.
  Output: Hasil operasi sebagai bilangan riil atau teks "unknown operation".
  Catatan: Spesifikasi sumber tidak menetapkan perilaku jika operator '/' menerima b = 0; test case tidak menggunakan b = 0.

question_en:
Given an operator character and two real numbers, perform the following operation:
  - '+': addition;
  - '-': subtract the second number from the first;
  - '*': multiplication;
  - '/': divide the first number by the second;
  - any other operator: output "unknown operation".
  Input: One operator character followed by two real numbers a and b.
  Output: The result as a real number or the text "unknown operation".
  Note: The source specification does not define behavior when operator '/' receives b = 0; the test cases do not use b = 0.

