question_ind:
Diberikan tiga bilangan riil positif yang dianggap sebagai panjang sisi. Tentukan satu klasifikasi dengan prioritas berikut:
  1. "Not a triangle" jika tidak memenuhi ketaksamaan segitiga;
  2. "Equilateral triangle" jika ketiga sisi sama;
  3. "Isosceles triangle" jika setidaknya dua sisi sama setelah kasus equilateral dikeluarkan;
  4. "Right triangle" jika memenuhi teorema Pythagoras;
  5. "Obtuse triangle" jika kuadrat sisi terpanjang lebih besar daripada jumlah kuadrat dua sisi lain;
  6. "Acute triangle" untuk kasus segitiga lainnya.
  Input: Tiga bilangan riil positif a, b, dan c.
  Output: Tepat satu teks klasifikasi di atas.
  Catatan: Prioritas diperlukan karena klasifikasi berdasarkan sisi dan sudut dapat tumpang tindih.

question_en:
Given three positive real numbers that are intended as side lengths, output exactly one classification using this priority:
  1. "Not a triangle" when the triangle inequality is not satisfied;
  2. "Equilateral triangle" when all sides are equal;
  3. "Isosceles triangle" when at least two sides are equal after excluding the equilateral case;
  4. "Right triangle" when the Pythagorean relation holds;
  5. "Obtuse triangle" when the square of the longest side is greater than the sum of the other two squares;
  6. "Acute triangle" for every other valid triangle.
  Input: Three positive real numbers a, b, and c.
  Output: Exactly one classification text listed above.
  Note: The priority is required because side-based and angle-based classifications may overlap.

