question_ind:
Tulislah algoritma untuk menghitung dan mengklasifikasikan Body Mass Index (BMI).
  Input: Dua bilangan riil positif: berat dalam gram dan tinggi dalam sentimeter.
  Output: Teks:
  - "Underweight" jika BMI < 18.5;
  - "Normal" jika 18.5 <= BMI <= 25;
  - "Overweight" jika 25 < BMI < 40;
  - "Obese" jika BMI >= 40.
  Catatan: BMI = berat_kg / tinggi_m^2, sehingga untuk satuan input tersebut BMI = berat_gram * 10 / tinggi_cm^2.

question_en:
Write an algorithm to compute and classify Body Mass Index (BMI).
  Input: Two positive real numbers: weight in grams and height in centimeters.
  Output:
  - "Underweight" when BMI < 18.5;
  - "Normal" when 18.5 <= BMI <= 25;
  - "Overweight" when 25 < BMI < 40;
  - "Obese" when BMI >= 40.
  Note: BMI = weight_kg / height_m^2, so for the given input units BMI = weight_grams * 10 / height_cm^2.

